        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Many answers, for example $40-3x=22$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Choose }3x:\\quad 3(6)&=18\\\\40-18&=22\\\\\\text{so }40-3x&=22\\end{align*}$$Any numbers $p$ and $q$ give a valid equation $p-qx=p-6q$.",
